.idea/

## Mac
.DS_Store

## Test Results
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage

## SQLite temporary files (keep main .db file for assignment submission)
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Note: We are tracking the main database file (HealthTracker.db) for assignment submission
# This allows tutors to run the application with seed data and test user without additional setup
# The database is created and seeded via Entity Framework migrations on first run
# Configuration is managed via Constants.cs (modern .NET 9.0 approach, not App.config)